Industrial Mini Project (30 Marks)
Project Title

Customer Support Ticket Processing System

A software company receives customer complaints.

Example Data

tickets = [
"   Laptop is Not Working   ",
"My Password is forgotten",
"Server ERROR occurred",
"Need Refund immediately",
"Email not received"
]
Requirements

Your program must:

Step 1

Clean spaces using

strip()
Step 2

Convert every ticket into Title Case

title()
Step 3

Count total tickets

Step 4

Search tickets containing

Password
Refund
Error
Email

using

find()
Step 5

Replace

Error

with

Issue
Step 6

Print tickets in aligned table

using

center()
ljust()
rjust()
Step 7

Generate report

-----------------------------------------
Customer Support Report
-----------------------------------------

Total Tickets : 5

Password Issues : 1

Refund Requests : 1

Email Problems : 1

Server Issues : 1

